{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:36 2026-10-24 HKT</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>八鄉粉錦公路今日（24日）發生交通意外，一輛私家車失控鏟上巴士站撞向小巴，及後更撞傷3名等車的途人。事後網上流傳一段車CAM影片，片中見到一輛萬事得開篷跑車沿粉錦公路往上水方向行駛，前方有一輛私家車，至打石湖巴士站時，一輛小巴在巴士站停下上落客，私家車隨即扭右越線駛走，惟萬事得收掣不及剷上巴士站，再猛撞小巴。</p>\n<p>片段見到，當時巴士站有數名途人候車，其中一名男子坐在巴士站的石凳上，幸未被直接撞及，另有人疑被萬事得撞到，由旁人攙扶緩緩起身，一名非華裔女子則緊抱受驚小童，尖叫聲四起。</p>\n<img alt=\"一輛萬事得開篷跑車沿粉錦公路往上水方向行駛。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34cb7eb185554591ad89b4b7d683bc2c/2026-10/AQMmQxLr5P8VEzRFXN0txQh5KBpCN3jc3Bv56zkOay38I_4vOwXiSIx-2rz87RSYAJiP1OLOlqzZe1oiuJPNW2qyNbUuE_MVOTxL_S-pTA8QkQ_mp4_snapshot_00_03_827.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"萬事得收掣不及剷上巴士站，再猛撞小巴。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81c4711e163e7f5b7d63ca49cddd46c5/2026-10/AQMmQxLr5P8VEzRFXN0txQh5KBpCN3jc3Bv56zkOay38I_4vOwXiSIx-2rz87RSYAJiP1OLOlqzZe1oiuJPNW2qyNbUuE_MVOTxL_S-pTA8QkQ_mp4_snapshot_00_05_313.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"萬事得收掣不及剷上巴士站，再猛撞小巴。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59b71b0a44895029a96aa31e46315e17/2026-10/AQMmQxLr5P8VEzRFXN0txQh5KBpCN3jc3Bv56zkOay38I_4vOwXiSIx-2rz87RSYAJiP1OLOlqzZe1oiuJPNW2qyNbUuE_MVOTxL_S-pTA8QkQ_mp4_snapshot_00_08_053.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有候車的途人疑被萬事得撞到，由旁人攙扶緩緩起身。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb8dcc61d9c5993bdc9297fcec00add9/2026-10/AQMmQxLr5P8VEzRFXN0txQh5KBpCN3jc3Bv56zkOay38I_4vOwXiSIx-2rz87RSYAJiP1OLOlqzZe1oiuJPNW2qyNbUuE_MVOTxL_S-pTA8QkQ_mp4_snapshot_00_12_347.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有候車的途人疑被萬事得撞到，由旁人攙扶緩緩起身。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/926624e7e713121e2376a70149b7a010/2026-10/AQMmQxLr5P8VEzRFXN0txQh5KBpCN3jc3Bv56zkOay38I_4vOwXiSIx-2rz87RSYAJiP1OLOlqzZe1oiuJPNW2qyNbUuE_MVOTxL_S-pTA8QkQ_mp4_snapshot_00_14_051.jpg\"/>\n<p>事件發生於今日早上8時許，一輛往上水方向行駛的公共小巴在路旁停車落客，正準備重新起步之際，突遭一輛尾隨的私家車從後猛烈撞擊，私家車更剷上行人路，導致在巴士站候車3名市民無辜受傷，包括一男一女及一名6歲女童，幸僅輕傷俱送院救治。警方正調查意外原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"私家車稍後被拖走檢驗。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1493a72476d03b8934efdf87bb821819/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_23_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小巴司機鄭先生幸無恙。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88b55535c9f2404937bbb792b6759752/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_22.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b13018b4bda10dce3f7b0062915206f3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_22_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f642cea6255548dd9c2e1b30f60528fd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32797c402739b3873f2261ffce1a15e5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8364b2fb598cb4ea2763ef1e24a6819/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_24_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"私家車擋風玻璃爆裂。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f23f67b039ce2536c163f926fa7883e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_24_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd9b9eba2c750502cefb042ddb688b21/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_25_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f8e3f5f502b215c1c908d5fd18c95bb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_26.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b73459b5041e0d970c2e4cab3c79cb6e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_26_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"私家車剷上行人路撞巴士站候車途人。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5499d246dbb9e465b7c77e2a869d2dd3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_28.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea1d8bd7775a88e763bafe7dbf43c61f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_29.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e673b70a865651e2f044cc5089989c70/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_26_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16c6c639a125204a094cf9f2f7400382/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-24_at_10_14_25.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:02:46.820230+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":390,"images":19,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T08:36:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T14:18:29.434404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T08:58:34.921685+00:00","content_hash":"ee40dc2f078fe4e0f43332bb9d3d871964a9d0b65fa1c77a15f4890ad3660bc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}